  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nFor some reason (not yet clear to me, I assume some complication related to Window objects or something) Origin.from uses type _any_ and then internally handles that almost like a WebIDL union, but not quite. Especially string handling is different. WebIDL goes through https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#js-DOMString but [Origin.from](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-origin-from) just checks the explicit type string.\n\n@mikewest @annevk @zcorpan ",
